                            when="1928-05-22T13:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 22, 1928—1
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>143. Reparation 49. Your Reparation 89.<anchor n="53" xml:id="d765-f1"/>
